# One line-ending convention on every host (CR-002). The frozen-file manifest
# hashes the LF form, gofmt requires LF, and checks compare text: Git's global
# core.autocrlf=true on Windows must not rewrite the working tree to CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Recorded fixtures keep the exact bytes they were recorded with (some were
# captured with CRLF); Git must never convert these on checkout.
test/vectors/** -text
